# 云服务代理

# Wasabi Oregon path-style object-storage endpoint used by CHM collection images.
# Exact regional host only; do not cover unrelated regions or bucket subdomains.
# https://docs.wasabi.com/docs/service-urls-for-wasabis-storage-regions
DOMAIN,s3.us-west-1.wasabisys.com

# Shared email links, unsubscribe pages and subscription preferences.
# The observed flow is unsubscribe/link navigation. Keep its existing proxy path;
# these exact hosts may also track clicks, so a whole-host reject breaks the flow.
# https://support.iterable.com/hc/en-us/articles/24886914774548-Easy-Unsubscribe-and-List-Unsubscribe-Email-Headers
DOMAIN,links.airalo.com
DOMAIN,links.iterable.com
DOMAIN,email.mckinsey.com
DOMAIN,campaigns.techspecs.io
DOMAIN,hs-46233949.s.hubspotemail.net
DOMAIN,links.warp.dev
DOMAIN,app.loops.so
DOMAIN,05.emailinboundprocessing.com
DOMAIN,unsub.cmail19.com
DOMAIN,means.us8.list-manage.com
DOMAIN,t.daily.dev
DOMAIN,us1.clevertap-prod.com
DOMAIN,email-marriott.com
DOMAIN,pdx1.qualtrics.com
DOMAIN,dcic.musvc6.net
DOMAIN,email.engagelab.com
DOMAIN,link.email.nianticlabs.com
DOMAIN,www.unsubscribe.nianticlabs.com
DOMAIN,www\.unsubscribe.nianticlabs.com
DOMAIN,link.goat.com

# Verification used by interactive forms; preserve the existing proxy path.
# https://docs.mtcaptcha.com/
DOMAIN,service.mtcaptcha.com
DOMAIN,service2.mtcaptcha.com

# Apollo's shared application bundles also host its tracking loader.
# The dedicated collection host is rejected separately; do not block this CDN.
DOMAIN,assets.apollo.io

# WorkOS enterprise SSO endpoints loaded by the app's login flow. Observed falling
# through to FINAL on 2026-10-12 (js.workos.com, api.workos.com).
# https://workos.com/docs
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,workos.com

# Luma event/calendar service and the observed Wise public/account entry point.
# Classification only: no credentials, financial transactions or account tests.
DOMAIN,api.luma.com
DOMAIN,luma.com
DOMAIN,wise.com

# Observed OKX business CNAMEs: main site, Web3, and exchange/DEX WebSockets.
# OKX publishes wspri/wsdexpri under socketBaseUrls: https://web3.okx.com/
# Exact aliases only; include the escaped www spelling observed in client logs.
DOMAIN,www.okx.com.cdn.cloudflare.net
DOMAIN,www\.okx.com.cdn.cloudflare.net
DOMAIN,web3.okx.com.cdn.cloudflare.net
DOMAIN,wspri.okx.com.cdn.cloudflare.net
DOMAIN,wsdexpri.okx.com.cdn.cloudflare.net

# Adobe identity, regional lookup, Document Cloud API, and commerce services.
# Keep the observed proxy exit consistent; exact hosts preserve Adobe privacy denies.
# dc-api also handles CSP reports; blocking the shared host would break document APIs.
DOMAIN,adobeid-na1.services.adobe.com
DOMAIN,geo-dc.adobe.com
DOMAIN,dc-api.adobe.io
DOMAIN,commerce.adobe.com
